WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.169 --> 00:00:04.430
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: No promising to make

00:00:04.430 --> 00:00:06.220
people into Magical Girls!

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:10.660
Listen, lots of us have dreamed of becoming
heroes with magical powers, fighting for love,

00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:13.139
truth, and justice, and battling evil in a
pretty dress!

00:00:13.139 --> 00:00:14.490
I know I have.

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:18.690
But don't let Dr. Bright trick you into thinking
he's able to dispense that kind of power.

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:22.750
The amulet is not a "soul gem," nor is it
imbued with any supernatural powers that can

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:26.949
be connected to the moon or any of the planets
in our solar system.

00:00:26.949 --> 00:00:30.580
Don't trust him, even if he promises to include
a "magical girl outfit."

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:31.660
That sounds...creepy.

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:35.789
If he says that to you, spray him with some
pepper spray.

